	"data": "Mycelium and Software 4.0: Convergent Autopoiesis\n\nCross-pollination between mycorrhizal network biology and the Software 4.0 paradigm paper. Two domains, billions of years apart, arriving at the same network topology through different selection pressures.\n\nThe Two Domains\n\nDomain A: Mycorrhizal Networks (Biology)\n\nUnderground fungal networks — the \"Wood Wide Web\" — connect trees across forests through mycelial threads. These networks are not static infrastructure. They are living,…",
